#. module: om_whatsapp_account
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_whatsapp_account
msgid ""
"Bridge between Invoicing and the WhatsApp connector of Odoo Mates: ready "
"WhatsApp templates and a Send by WhatsApp button on customer invoices, "
"credit notes and payments, the PDF attached and the link to view and pay the"
" invoice online, and optional automatic sending when an invoice is posted or"
" a payment confirmed."
msgstr ""

